# Solreign Meridian lore — memo addendum coda + Specimen Zero field log.
# Text is baked into paper entities in Resources/Prototypes/_Solreign/Entities/meridian_identity.yml.
# The 4 memos below are an explicit CONTINUATION of the Oasis Auditor's Memo trail
# (Resources/Locale/en-US/_solreign/lore-papers.ftl's solreign-lore-memo-{1-8}) — same voice, same
# Auditor, a short coda rather than a renumbering of the original 8-step trail.

## ── MERIDIAN MEMO ADDENDUM (continuation of the Oasis trail) ───────────────

solreign-lore-meridian-memo-1 =
    SOLREIGN INTERNAL MEMORANDUM — ADDENDUM, MERIDIAN STATION
    FROM: The Auditor (Office of Preemptive Bookkeeping, decommissioned)

    "You found all eight on Oasis. Good. That was the training course. The
    trail continues here, on Meridian — assuming Meridian still exists by the
    time you read this. Start where the research staff start: the Library."

solreign-lore-meridian-memo-2 =
    SOLREIGN INTERNAL MEMORANDUM — ADDENDUM, MERIDIAN STATION
    FROM: The Auditor (Office of Preemptive Bookkeeping, decommissioned)

    "The handbook fragments here are all filed correctly, for once. Read them
    in order. Page 200 was supposed to be the last page. It is not the last
    page. Ask the Chaplain about the ladder, if you can find them."

solreign-lore-meridian-memo-3 =
    SOLREIGN INTERNAL MEMORANDUM — ADDENDUM, MERIDIAN STATION
    FROM: The Auditor (Office of Preemptive Bookkeeping, decommissioned)

    "Whatever the Xenoarch team is keeping in the containment arena was not on
    the original manifest. I do not know who classified it 'Specimen Zero.'
    I do know the zero implies there was, at some point, a Specimen One."

solreign-lore-meridian-memo-4 =
    SOLREIGN INTERNAL MEMORANDUM — ADDENDUM, MERIDIAN STATION — FINAL
    FROM: The Auditor (Office of Preemptive Bookkeeping, decommissioned)

    "This is the last addendum I am authorized to leave. If you are reading a
    fifth memo on a third station, I did not write it, and neither, I
    suspect, did anyone still employed here. Balance your Ledger. Go home."

## ── SPECIMEN ZERO FIELD LOG (secret) ────────────────────────────────────────

solreign-lore-specimen-zero-log =
    XENOARCHAEOLOGY FIELD LOG — SPECIMEN ZERO
    ENTRY 1 OF ??

    "Acquired intact. No containment breach on intake, which the acquisition
    team insists is itself the anomaly. Scheduling entry 2 for tomorrow.
    Note to self: stop describing it as 'watching.' It does not have eyes."
